{"seq":1,"slug":"alerting-strategies","title":"告警策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/observability-engineering/alerting-incident/alerting-strategies","wordCount":1251,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"告警策略\">告警策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>告警策略（Alerting Strategy）定义了系统在什么条件下通知运维人员采取行动。有效的告警策略追求高信噪比——关键问题及时触发告警（避免遗漏），同时减少误报和低价值告警（避免告警疲劳）。告警疲劳（Alert Fatigue）是可观测性实践中最严重的组织问题，当告警数量过多且频繁误报时，运维人员开始忽略告警，导致真正的关键问题被错过。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[指标数据流] --&gt; B[告警规则引擎]&#10;    B --&gt; C{条件满足?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[Pending 状态]&#10;    D --&gt; E{持续超过阈值?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[Firing 状态]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[恢复 Resolved]&#10;    F --&gt; H[告警路由]&#10;    H --&gt; I[通知渠道]&#10;    I --&gt; J[值班人员]&#10;    F --&gt; K[告警分组]&#10;    K --&gt; L[抑制重复告警]\">graph TD\n    A[指标数据流] --&gt; B[告警规则引擎]\n    B --&gt; C{条件满足?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[Pending 状态]\n    D --&gt; E{持续超过阈值?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[Firing 状态]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[恢复 Resolved]\n    F --&gt; H[告警路由]\n    H --&gt; I[通知渠道]\n    I --&gt; J[值班人员]\n    F --&gt; K[告警分组]\n    K --&gt; L[抑制重复告警]</pre><p>告警分级与响应标准：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>严重度</th>\n<th>响应时间</th>\n<th>通知方式</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P0 / Critical</td>\n<td>服务完全不可用</td>\n<td>5 分钟内响应</td>\n<td>电话 + 短信 + IM</td>\n<td>生产环境宕机、数据丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P1 / High</td>\n<td>核心功能严重降级</td>\n<td>15 分钟内响应</td>\n<td>短信 + IM</td>\n<td>支付失败率 &gt; 5%、延迟 &gt; 5s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P2 / Medium</td>\n<td>部分功能受影响</td>\n<td>1 小时内响应</td>\n<td>IM 消息</td>\n<td>非核心服务错误率升高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3 / Low</td>\n<td>潜在风险或降级</td>\n<td>下一工作日</td>\n<td>工单/邮件</td>\n<td>磁盘使用率 &gt; 80%、证书即将过期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基于-slo-的告警\">基于 SLO 的告警</h2><p>基于 SLO（Service Level Objective）的告警是最有效的告警策略，它直接衡量用户体验而非底层资源指标。传统告警基于资源阈值（CPU &gt; 80%），但资源利用率高不一定影响用户；SLO 告警基于用户可感知的服务质量（成功率 &lt; 99.9%、P99 延迟 &gt; 500ms）。</p>\n<p>错误预算燃烧速率（Error Budget Burn Rate）是 SLO 告警的核心指标。如果 SLO 是 99.9%（月度错误预算 = 0.1% × 30天 = 43.2 分钟），燃烧速率 1x 表示按正常速率消耗错误预算（月底刚好用完），10x 表示以 10 倍速率消耗（4.32 天就会耗尽）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"promql\" data-code=\"# 1小时燃烧速率（快速检测）&#10;(&#10;  sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~&quot;5..&quot;}[1h]))&#10;  /&#10;  sum(rate(http_requests_total[1h]))&#10;) / (1 - 0.999) &gt; 14.4&#10;&#10;# 6小时燃烧速率（避免误报）&#10;(&#10;  sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~&quot;5..&quot;}[6h]))&#10;  /&#10;  sum(rate(http_requests_total[6h]))&#10;) / (1 - 0.999) &gt; 6\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 1小时燃烧速率（快速检测）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[1h]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sum(rate(http_requests_total[1h]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) / (1 - 0.999) > 14.4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 6小时燃烧速率（避免误报）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[6h]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sum(rate(http_requests_total[6h]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) / (1 - 0.999) > 6</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多窗口多燃烧速率告警（Multi-Window Multi-Burn-Rate Alerts）是 Google SRE 推荐的告警模式。通过组合短窗口（1h）高燃烧速率（14.4x）和长窗口（6h）中燃烧速率（6x）的条件，在快速检测和低误报之间取得平衡：短窗口捕捉突发问题，长窗口确认持续恶化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"alertmanager-配置\">Alertmanager 配置</h2><p>Prometheus Alertmanager 是告警管理的核心组件，负责告警的分组（Grouping）、抑制（Inhibition）、静默（Silencing）和路由（Routing）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"global:&#10;  resolve_timeout: 5m&#10;  slack_api_url: &#39;https://hooks.slack.com/services/...&#39;&#10;&#10;route:&#10;  receiver: default-slack&#10;  group_by: [&#39;alertname&#39;, &#39;service&#39;]&#10;  group_wait: 30s&#10;  group_interval: 5m&#10;  repeat_interval: 4h&#10;  routes:&#10;    - match:&#10;        severity: critical&#10;      receiver: pagerduty-critical&#10;      group_wait: 10s&#10;      repeat_interval: 30m&#10;    - match:&#10;        severity: warning&#10;      receiver: slack-warning&#10;      group_wait: 1m&#10;&#10;inhibit_rules:&#10;  - source_match:&#10;      severity: critical&#10;    target_match:&#10;      severity: warning&#10;    equal: [&#39;service&#39;]&#10;&#10;receivers:&#10;  - name: pagerduty-critical&#10;    pagerduty_configs:&#10;      - routing_key: &#39;&lt;key&gt;&#39;&#10;        severity: critical&#10;  - name: slack-warning&#10;    slack_configs:&#10;      - channel: &#39;#ops-alerts&#39;&#10;        title: &#39;{{ .GroupLabels.alertname }}&#39;&#10;        text: &#39;{{ range .Alerts }}{{ .Annotations.summary }}{{ end }}&#39;&#10;  - name: default-slack&#10;    slack_configs:&#10;      - channel: &#39;#ops-default&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">global</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  resolve_timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  slack_api_url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://hooks.slack.com/services/...'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  receiver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default-slack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  group_by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alertname'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  group_wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  group_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  repeat_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">4h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  routes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receiver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pagerduty-critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      group_wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      repeat_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receiver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slack-warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      group_wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">inhibit_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">source_match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    target_match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    equal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pagerduty-critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    pagerduty_configs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">routing_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;key>'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slack-warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    slack_configs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#ops-alerts'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{ .GroupLabels.alertname }}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{ range .Alerts }}{{ .Annotations.summary }}{{ end }}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default-slack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    slack_configs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#ops-default'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>告警分组将相同类型的告警合并为一条通知，避免同一问题触发大量独立告警。抑制规则在高级别告警触发时自动抑制低级别的相关告警——当服务 Critical 告警生效时，同一服务的 Warning 告警被自动静默。静默功能用于在计划维护期间临时屏蔽指定告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警治理与质量优化\">告警治理与质量优化</h2><p>告警质量需要持续治理，定期审查告警的有效性、响应率和误报率。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>治理指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>健康目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>告警触发频率</td>\n<td>每周告警总数</td>\n<td>持续下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误报率</td>\n<td>无需操作的告警 / 总告警</td>\n<td>&lt; 10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应时间</td>\n<td>告警触发到确认的时间</td>\n<td>P0: &lt;5m, P1: &lt;15m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解决时间</td>\n<td>告警触发到恢复的时间</td>\n<td>持续下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>告警覆盖率</td>\n<td>有告警覆盖的关键路径 / 总关键路径</td>\n<td>&gt; 95%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>告警审查会议（Alert Review）每月或每季度进行一次，团队共同审查所有告警规则：移除不再有效的告警、调整频繁误报的阈值、为新增服务补充告警覆盖、验证告警文档的准确性。每条告警规则应包含 Runbook 链接，指导值班人员在收到告警后如何诊断和处理。</p>\n<p>告警文档（Runbook）的标准结构包括：告警含义（什么指标异常说明什么问题）、影响范围（哪些用户/功能受影响）、诊断步骤（如何确认问题和定位根因）、修复步骤（标准操作流程）和升级路径（何时需要升级到高级工程师或管理层）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>有效告警策略追求高信噪比——关键问题不遗漏（高召回率）且误报最小化（高精确率），告警疲劳是可观测性实践中最严重的组织问题</li>\n<li>SLO 告警基于用户可感知的服务质量而非底层资源指标，错误预算燃烧速率量化服务质量恶化速度</li>\n<li>多窗口多燃烧速率模式（短窗口 1h + 长窗口 6h）在快速检测突发问题和避免误报之间取得平衡</li>\n<li>Alertmanager 通过分组（合并同类告警）、抑制（高级别屏蔽低级别）和路由（按严重程度分发）管理告警生命周期</li>\n<li>告警治理通过月度审查会议和质量指标（误报率&lt;10%、响应时间、告警覆盖率&gt;95%）持续优化告警系统</li>\n<li>每条告警规则必须附带 Runbook（含告警含义、影响范围、诊断步骤、修复步骤和升级路径），指导值班人员完成诊断和修复</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"告警策略","id":"告警策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基于 SLO 的告警","id":"基于-slo-的告警"},{"level":2,"text":"Alertmanager 配置","id":"alertmanager-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"告警治理与质量优化","id":"告警治理与质量优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"链路分析与性能诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/observability-engineering/distributed-tracing/trace-analysis"},"next":{"title":"事件管理流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/observability-engineering/alerting-incident/incident-management"}}